  "applicationText": {
    "title": "事務所探し",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l46-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "老陈和森今天必须选定上海事务所的所址。一大早，两人就离开宾馆，在房产商的带领下，看了很多地方。另外，森初次来到上海，还想到各处去看一看。",
        "translationZh": "老陈和森今天必须选定上海事务所的所址。一大早，两人就离开宾馆，在房产商的带领下，看了很多地方。另外，森初次来到上海，还想到各处去看一看。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "老陈和森今天必须选定上海事务所的所址。一大早，两人就离开宾馆，在房产商的带领下，看了很多地方。另外，森初次来到上海，还想到各处去看一看。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l46-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "一大早他们就开始物色",
        "translationZh": "一大早他们就开始物色",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（一大早他们就开始物色）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l46-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "陳さん、今日中に事務所の候補地を探すんですよね。",
            "translationZh": "陈先生，我们得在今天之内找到事务所的候选地点吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：陳さん、今日中に事務所の候補地を探すんですよね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.38,
              "duration": 4.38,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "陳",
            "text": "ええ。来月の初めまでには、開設の準備を済ませたいので。",
            "translationZh": "是啊。因为我想在下月初之前把开设准备工作做好。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陳：ええ。来月の初めまでには、開設の準備を済ませたいので。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.58,
              "duration": 3.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l46-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "他们一边看一边商量",
        "translationZh": "他们一边看一边商量",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（他们一边看一边商量）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l46-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ここ、いいんじゃないですか？",
            "translationZh": "这里不是挺好吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ここ、いいんじゃないですか？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 1.86,
              "duration": 1.86,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "陳",
            "text": "うーん、でも、なんだか教室みたいな所ですね。",
            "translationZh": "嗯，可是，总觉得像教室一样的地方呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陳：うーん、でも、なんだか教室みたいな所ですね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.9,
              "duration": 2.9,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-003",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "広くて、明るくて、交通の便もいいし、働きやすいと思いますよ。",
            "translationZh": "又宽敞，又明亮，交通也方便，我觉得很适合工作。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：広くて、明るくて、交通の便もいいし、働きやすいと思いますよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.3,
              "duration": 5.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-004",
            "speaker": "陳",
            "text": "さっきのはもっと広かったんじゃないですか？",
            "translationZh": "刚才那个不是更宽敞吗？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陳：さっきのはもっと広かったんじゃないですか？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.46,
              "duration": 2.46,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-005",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "でも、ちょっとうるさかったですね。部屋の中を見ている間、外でずっと車の音がしていましたよ。",
            "translationZh": "可是有点吵呢。我们看房间的时候，外面一直有车声。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：でも、ちょっとうるさかったですね。部屋の中を見ている間、外でずっと車の音がしていましたよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 7.81,
              "duration": 7.81,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:33:47.776Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "880d2e31d0532b73337b3b0afe765ace0112af263f7ba74581ecaf607f3dca65"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-006",
            "speaker": "陳",
            "text": "そうですね…。",
            "translationZh": "是啊……",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陳：そうですね…。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l46-app-block-005-line-006",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson46/l46-app-block-005-line-006.mp3",
